ering a variety of datasets and performance metrics into consideration. It has been inferred that all the three parallel architectures have higher performance when compared with the existing classification systems. Also, our IELU performs better than the widely used activation functions in text classification application.","topics":[],"score":254268,"global_rank":57891,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10604},{"name":"mjsir911/vorcompress","owner":"mjsir911","html_url":"https://github.com/mjsir911/vorcompress","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":254267,"global_rank":57893,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10605},{"name":"jeffeverett/robinhood-git-hook","owner":"jeffeverett","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffeverett/robinhood-git-hook","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Incentivize frequent commits by displaying Robinhood positions and portfolio value after every commit.","topics":[],"score":254261,"global_rank":57900,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10606},{"name":"jmategk0/airflow_examples","owner":"jmategk0","html_url":"https://github.com/jmategk0/airflow_examples","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"some examples of airflow dags","topics":[],"score":254255,"global_rank":57906,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10607},{"name":"stuarth/ecs-utils","owner":"stuarth","html_url":"https://github.com/stuarth/ecs-utils","stars":2,"forks":2,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":254254,"global_rank":57907,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10608},{"name":"jackallard17/REMIS","owner":"jackallard17","html_url":"https://github.com/jackallard17/REMIS","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":5,"language":"Python","description":"Source code for the Remarkably Efficient Mass Inoculation System (REMIS) by Fungaia, a peri